{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CftHCJTxfchczcZs935cV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Verdict: don't build the full app yet.** Use the ten days to test whether the problem is painful enough to pay for.\n\n**Facts:** Three organisers say they'd use it. There are no observed failures, usage data or payment commitments. \"Would use\" is weak evidence.\n\n**Hypotheses (unverified):**\n- H1: Organisers miss decisions or tasks buried in email and group threads.\n- H2: A weekly summary is useful enough that they ask for it again.\n- H3: Organisers, or their clubs, will pay.\n\n**Ten-day plan:**\n1. **Days 1–2:** Interview the three organisers. Ask for a recent example of a missed or costly item. If none exists, stop and reassess.\n2. **Days 3–6:** With their consent, produce summaries of their real threads by hand or with a script, and send them by email. Skip the UI.\n3. **Days 7–10:** Track whether they read the summaries, act on them, and ask for the next one unprompted. Ask for a pilot or price commitment.\n\nBuild only if H1 and H2 hold. If they hold but H3 fails, reconsider the business model before building."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3203,"cache_read_input_tokens":9381,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3203},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"794ad915-606c-4799-a427-7a87ba9eb649","uuid":"f1632012-5095-471a-b879-bab681f47fe7","timestamp":"2026-10-10T08:58:14.691Z","request_id":"req_011CftHCJFZUMWS36aCGkbDP"}
